      "purpose": "A utility program (CRTFRMSTMF) that creates an IBM i object from an IFS stream file. It retrieves the stream file's CCSID via the Qp0lGetAttr API, creates a temporary source physical file in QTEMP, copies the stream file content into it using CPYFRMSTMF, then executes a user-specified CL create command (e.g. CRTBNDCL, CRTDSPF, CRTSRVPGM, etc.) via QCAPCMD. Includes error handling with QMHMOVPM and QMHSNDPM APIs, and a local errno wrapper procedure.",
